<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/app-head', {
        title: 'FlyNotify',
        description: 'FlyNotify adalah gateway WhatsApp untuk push notification, API key, template, dan monitoring pengiriman.'
    }) %>
    <style>
        /* Override page-specific settings if any */
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-zinc-50/50 text-zinc-900 antialiased min-h-screen">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-6 sm:px-6 sm:py-8">
        <!-- Navigation -->
        <nav class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg flex flex-col gap-4 px-6 py-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <img src="/icons/flynotify-icon.svg" alt="FlyNotify" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-md border border-zinc-200">
                <div>
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500">Third-Party Gateway</p>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 leading-none mt-0.5">FlyNotify</h1>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <a href="#features" class="inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-50">Features</a>
                <a href="/login" class="inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-zinc-900 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-50 shadow transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-900/90">Open Console</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr]">
            <section class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-emerald-200/50 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">
                        No-code-ish WhatsApp gateway
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-tight">
                        Push notif
                        <span class="text-emerald-700">langsung</span>
                        ke WhatsApp.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-zinc-500 sm:text-lg">
                        FlyNotify dibuat sebagai third-party relay. Hubungkan satu nomor WhatsApp, generate API key, lalu kirim pesan dari app lain via endpoint internal.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <a href="/login" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-zinc-900 px-5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-50 shadow transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-900/90">Masuk Dashboard</a>
                    <a href="/scan" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-50">Connect WhatsApp</a>
                </div>
                
                <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-8">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-400">API Key</p>
                        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-600">Generate key per app / tenant.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-400">Push Endpoint</p>
                        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-600">POST payload ke `/api/push` dengan `x-api-key`.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-400">Live Console</p>
                        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-600">Lihat status bot, template, dan riwayat kirim.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <aside class="space-y-6 flex flex-col">
                <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm flex-1">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-400">Quick Flow</p>
                    <ol class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-600">
                        <li class="flex gap-2">
                            <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-800">1.</span>
                            <span>Connect WhatsApp via QR.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-2">
                            <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-800">2.</span>
                            <span>Generate API key untuk client app.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-2">
                            <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-800">3.</span>
                            <span>Test kirim dari dashboard.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-2">
                            <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-800">4.</span>
                            <span>Integrasikan endpoint `/api/push`.</span>
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
                
                <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-400 mb-3">Sample Payload</p>
                    <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-100 leading-relaxed">{
  "to": "+14155550123",
  "recipientName": "Rama",
  "message": "Halo {name}, order kamu sudah diproses.",
  "variables": {
    "name": "Rama"
  }
}</pre>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>

        <!-- Features Grid -->
        <section id="features" class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 mb-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-key text-sm"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900">API Key Vault</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Generate, copy, dan rotasi key per integrasi langsung dari UI admin console.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 mb-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-paper-plane text-sm"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900">Manual Push</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Tes langsung pengiriman ke satu atau banyak nomor dari console dengan cepat.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 mb-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-file-lines text-sm"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900">Templates</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Simpan template pesan WhatsApp reusable untuk reminder, billing, dan alert.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 mb-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-clock-rotate-left text-sm"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900">Delivery History</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Pantau history dan log status pengiriman pesan yang dipicu dari API/dashboard.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
